WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.940
Matthew, 28 Now after the Sabbath, toward the dawn of

00:06.940 --> 00:11.480
the first day of the week, Mary Magdalene and the other Mary went to see the tomb.

00:12.200 --> 00:16.740
And behold, there was a great earthquake, for an angel of the Lord descended from heaven

00:16.740 --> 00:20.120
and came and rolled back the stone and sat on it.

00:20.620 --> 00:24.880
His appearance was like lightning, and his clothing white as snow.

00:25.200 --> 00:29.280
And for fear of him the guards trembled and became like dead men.

00:29.280 --> 00:35.260
But the angel said to the women, Do not be afraid, for I know that you seek

00:35.260 --> 00:36.600
Jesus who was crucified.

00:37.480 --> 00:40.740
He is not here, for he is risen as he said.

00:41.440 --> 00:43.680
Come, see the place where he lay.

00:44.300 --> 00:48.400
Then go quickly and tell his disciples that he is risen from the dead.

00:48.920 --> 00:51.840
And behold, he is going before you to Galilee.

00:52.480 --> 00:53.720
There you will see him.

00:54.320 --> 00:56.040
See, I have told you.

00:56.380 --> 00:58.680
So they departed quickly from the tomb.

00:58.680 --> 01:03.380
With fear and great joy, and ran to tell his disciples.

01:04.060 --> 01:07.460
And behold, Jesus met them and said,

01:08.220 --> 01:08.740
Greetings.

01:09.940 --> 01:13.420
And they came up and took hold of his feet and worshipped him.

01:14.120 --> 01:15.360
Then Jesus said to them,

01:16.100 --> 01:17.120
Do not be afraid.

01:17.740 --> 01:22.020
Go and tell my brothers to go to Galilee, and there they will see me.

01:23.700 --> 01:28.660
While they were going, behold, some of the guard went into the city and told the chief

01:28.680 --> 01:30.400
priests all that had taken place.

01:30.960 --> 01:35.380
And when they had assembled with the elders and taken counsel, they gave a sufficient

01:35.380 --> 01:37.740
sum of money to the soldiers and said,

01:38.320 --> 01:46.620
Tell people his disciples came by night and stole him away while we were asleep.

01:47.620 --> 01:57.220
And if this comes to the governor's ears, we will satisfy him and keep you out of trouble.

01:58.680 --> 02:01.160
So they took the money and did as they were directed.

02:01.340 --> 02:05.080
And this story has been spread among the Jews to this day.

02:05.980 --> 02:11.140
Now the eleven disciples went to Galilee, to the mountain to which Jesus had directed them.

02:11.700 --> 02:14.040
And when they saw him, they worshipped him.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.520
But some doubted.

02:16.180 --> 02:18.280
And Jesus came and said to them,

02:18.860 --> 02:22.600
All authority in heaven and on earth has been given to me.

02:23.500 --> 02:28.560
Go, therefore, and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the

02:28.560 --> 02:28.660
Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit, and of the Holy Spirit, and of the Holy Spirit,

02:28.660 --> 02:31.680
and of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit,

02:32.180 --> 02:35.180
teaching them to observe all that I have commanded you.

02:35.560 --> 02:39.980
And behold, I am with you always to the end of the age.

